<title>GREECE: KYRANIS ANALYST DIAMANTOPOULOS JOINS HERMES.</title>
<headline>KYRANIS ANALYST DIAMANTOPOULOS JOINS HERMES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equities analyst Iakovos Diamantopoulos, formerly with M. Kyranis Securities, has joined Hermes Brokerage as an investment advisor, market sources told Reuters on Tuesday. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
